{"seq":1,"slug":"agi-definitions-debates","title":"AGI 定义与争论","stage":"DONE","category":"agi-frontier","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates","rating":{"composite":4.12,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# AGI 定义与争论\n\n\"AGI 到底是什么\"这个问题听起来像哲学，但过去三年里它决定了数千亿美元的资本流向、几部法律的核心条款，以及无数工程师的职业选择。这不是一个可以绕过去的问题。\n\n本 hub 不试图给出第十一个定义，而是做一件更实用的事：把现有的定义、争论与相邻概念摊开在一张地图上。\n\n你会看清每一方站在哪里、用什么尺子测量、以及为什么他们量出的结果永远对不上。\n\n在整个 AGI 前沿系列中，本 hub 承担的是概念与话语层的基础设施角色。兄弟 hub 各管一段：规模定律 hub 讲训练侧的规律与苦涩教训，进展测量 hub 讲基准与评测方法本身，递归自我改进 hub 讲能力闭环的风险路径。\n\n它们都在回答\"AI 能力如何增长\"，而本 hub 回答的是一个更前置的问题——我们说的到底是同一件事吗。没有这层概念地基，那些技术性讨论很容易滑回各说各话。\n\n四条主线按递进顺序组织。\n\n第一章「定义谱系」从图灵讲到现代实验室量表，解决这个词从哪来、有哪几种用法、谁有权使用它。\n\n第二章「争论现场」进入当代最激烈的三个战场：当前模型够不够格、时间表可信度、经济转型快慢。\n\n第三章「相邻概念」辨析 ASI、变革性 AI 与意识问题这三个最容易与 AGI 混用的概念群。\n\n第四章「定义为何重要」收束到现实后果——政策法规、企业内部机制、以及你个人的认知工具箱。前三章是弹药，第四章是靶子；读完你会明白为什么每个定义细节都值得计较。\n\n推荐学习路径按读者画像分两条。\n\n技术从业者建议顺序通读四章，重点停留第一、二章的框架辨析部分；管理者与非技术读者可以从第三章的 TAI 一篇切入——它是最可操作的概念——再回头补第二章的经济之争，最后用第四章的工具箱收尾。\n\n前置要求很低：知道大语言模型的基本用法即可，所有专业概念在首次出现处都有就地解释。\n\n最后一个诚实的提醒：本 hub 的立场写在各篇的字里行间——AGI 没有公认定义这件事不是缺陷而是事实。任何宣称已给出终局定义的人，都值得你多问一句判据。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"definition-landscape","title":"定义谱系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/definition-landscape","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-agi-means","title":"AGI 到底指什么：定义史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/definition-landscape/what-agi-means"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kinds-of-intelligence","title":"弱人工智能、强人工智能与通用性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/definition-landscape/kinds-of-intelligence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"who-defines-agi","title":"谁来定义 AGI：实验室、学界与监管","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/definition-landscape/who-defines-agi"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"debate-battlefield","title":"争论现场","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/debate-battlefield","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"are-current-models-agi","title":"当前大模型算 AGI 吗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/debate-battlefield/are-current-models-agi"},{"seq":2,"slug":"timeline-forecasts","title":"AGI 时间表预测及其纪录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/debate-battlefield/timeline-forecasts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"economic-transformation-debate","title":"经济转型速度之争","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/debate-battlefield/economic-transformation-debate"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"adjacent-concepts","title":"相邻概念","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/adjacent-concepts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"asi-superintelligence","title":"ASI：超级智能概念史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/adjacent-concepts/asi-superintelligence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"transformative-ai","title":"变革性 AI（TAI）：更可操作的替代概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/adjacent-concepts/transformative-ai"},{"seq":3,"slug":"consciousness-question","title":"意识问题与 AGI 的纠缠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/adjacent-concepts/consciousness-question"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"why-definition-matters","title":"定义为何重要","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/why-definition-matters","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"definitions-drive-policy","title":"定义如何驱动政策与法规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/why-definition-matters/definitions-drive-policy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"definitions-in-industry","title":"工业界的操作性定义实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/why-definition-matters/definitions-in-industry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"clear-eyed-amid-hype","title":"在炒作中保持清醒的认知工具箱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/why-definition-matters/clear-eyed-amid-hype"}]}]}